      "seed": 1240840643,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 255073115,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795348237762,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. 解决什么问题",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. 解决什么问题",
      "lineHeight": 1.28,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "txt_0031",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2384,
      "y": 488.1,
      "width": 1775.3,
      "height": 92.4,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#212529",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 684561670,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1825831334,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795348237762,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. 解决传统经验记忆只保存含大量页面噪声的原始轨迹、或只从成功样本提取固定动作序列导致换场景即失效且无法吸取失败教训的问题；\n2. 提供跨会话可迁移的高层决策准则与防错约束，减少相似任务盲目试探步数。",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. 解决传统经验记忆只保存含大量页面噪声的原始轨迹、或只从成功样本提取固定动作序列导致换场景即失效且无法吸取失败教训的问题；\n2. 提供跨会话可迁移的高层决策准则与防错约束，减少相似任务盲目试探步数。",
      "lineHeight": 1.65,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "rect_0032",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 2356,
      "y": 663,
