      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795348237762,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. 输入构成（轻量清洗轨迹 + 无监督自评）",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. 输入构成（轻量清洗轨迹 + 无监督自评）",
      "lineHeight": 1.28,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "txt_0034",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2384,
      "y": 743.1,
      "width": 1732.2,
      "height": 92.4,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#212529",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1916010461,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 128698575,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795348237762,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. 任务原始问题指令与清洗后的轻量交互轨迹（剥离网页 DOM 树文本及无效空操作，仅保留每步「思考推理」与「执行动作」序列）；\n2. 无外部真值标签下，由同一基础大模型裁判给出的任务成败判定与归因分析文本。",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. 任务原始问题指令与清洗后的轻量交互轨迹（剥离网页 DOM 树文本及无效空操作，仅保留每步「思考推理」与「执行动作」序列）；\n2. 无外部真值标签下，由同一基础大模型裁判给出的任务成败判定与归因分析文本。",
      "lineHeight": 1.65,
      "autoResize": true
    },
