      "updated": 1795348237762,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. 标准输出 Schema（三段式高层推理与防错策略）",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. 标准输出 Schema（三段式高层推理与防错策略）",
      "lineHeight": 1.28,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "txt_0037",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2384,
      "y": 998.1,
      "width": 1587.7,
      "height": 138.6,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#212529",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 747311266,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1918606341,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795348237762,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• 触发条件：策略标题（Title）与适用边界描述（Description）——一句话明确界定何时适用以及何时严禁套用；\n• 策略动作：策略正文（Content）——1~3 句剥离具体网站域名、商品名与页面元素编号的通用核查步骤或失败预防准则；\n• 结果与出处：挂载在源任务的原始问题嵌入向量下。",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• 触发条件：策略标题（Title）与适用边界描述（Description）——一句话明确界定何时适用以及何时严禁套用；\n• 策略动作：策略正文（Content）——1~3 句剥离具体网站域名、商品名与页面元素编号的通用核查步骤或失败预防准则；\n• 结果与出处：挂载在源任务的原始问题嵌入向量下。",
      "lineHeight": 1.65,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
