      "locked": false,
      "text": "4. 存储形式与关键实证超参",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4. 存储形式与关键实证超参",
      "lineHeight": 1.28,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "txt_0040",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2384,
      "y": 1299.1,
      "width": 1727.7,
      "height": 92.4,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#212529",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1105654384,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1585057583,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795348237762,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• 存储形式：结构化文本 + 向量数据库；\n• 关键消融超参：单题单轨最多提炼 3 条（多轨对比最多 5 条）；在线检索召回 k = 1 最优（增至 k = 2, 3, 4 会因多策略冲突掉点）。",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• 存储形式：结构化文本 + 向量数据库；\n• 关键消融超参：单题单轨最多提炼 3 条（多轨对比最多 5 条）；在线检索召回 k = 1 最优（增至 k = 2, 3, 4 会因多策略冲突掉点）。",
      "lineHeight": 1.65,
      "autoResize": true
    },
